1
00:00:04,230 --> 00:00:06,330
It's a bit late to ask now, but how are you feeling?

2
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:12,290
I'm fine.

3
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:15,680
Honestly, it's almost more than I can handle.

4
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:19,300
With this I feel like I could pull off ten, or even twenty projections at once.

5
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:22,930
I'm just glad it worked.

6
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:27,950
Okay, now's our chance.

7
00:00:27,950 --> 00:00:28,950
Let's go.

8
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:36,580
Shirou and I will sneak into Ryuudou Temple from the rear,

9
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:38,650
and then we'll give you the signal, Saber.

10
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:42,470
When you see it, storm the temple through the front entrance

11
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:44,660
and draw his attention to you.

12
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:45,630
While you're doing that,

13
00:00:45,630 --> 00:00:49,300
we'll find Shinji and the Holy Grail and shut it down.

14
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:53,030
Once that's done, all that'll be left is for you to destroy the Grail.

15
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:56,050
Look, about that...

16
00:00:56,050 --> 00:00:57,130
Shirou.

17
00:00:57,590 --> 00:00:59,970
There is something I must tell you first.

18
00:00:59,970 --> 00:01:00,880
Saber?

19
00:01:02,330 --> 00:01:06,470
I will only be able to use my holy sword once.

20
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:09,320
She has too little mana.

21
00:01:09,320 --> 00:01:13,700
The instant she uses her sword, she'll vanish from this world.

22
00:01:13,700 --> 00:01:15,870
What? Why?

23
00:01:15,870 --> 00:01:17,160
Isn't it obvious?

24
00:01:17,160 --> 00:01:19,610
I'm supplying mana to two people.

25
00:01:21,360 --> 00:01:26,240
Hang on... You expect Saber to keep him busy without using her strongest attack?

26
00:01:26,240 --> 00:01:27,240
Shirou...

27
00:01:27,880 --> 00:01:29,830
This is my decision.

28
00:01:30,690 --> 00:01:32,460
There's no other choice.

29
00:01:32,460 --> 00:01:34,710
This is the only way to be sure.

30
00:01:35,610 --> 00:01:37,890
Saber is my Servant.

31
00:01:39,310 --> 00:01:41,480
Do you think I'd let her die for no reason?

32
00:03:32,880 --> 00:03:34,250
What the hell is that?

33
00:03:34,250 --> 00:03:36,660
The mana is taking physical form.

34
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:40,860
The air... It feels just like it did ten years ago.

35
00:03:40,860 --> 00:03:44,540
Which means that is the Holy Grail.

36
00:03:45,380 --> 00:03:48,100
The vessel must have been too small.

37
00:03:48,100 --> 00:03:52,160
So the Grail's contents are trying to burst the vessel and leak out.

38
00:03:52,160 --> 00:03:54,050
Burst the vessel?

39
00:03:54,050 --> 00:03:56,420
In other words, Shinji.

40
00:03:56,420 --> 00:04:00,140
He ought to be somewhere in there, linked to it as its core.

41
00:04:02,950 --> 00:04:04,680
Could that be him up there?

42
00:04:04,680 --> 00:04:07,020
I see something that looks like a person at the top.

43
00:04:07,710 --> 00:04:11,780
This time, it seems the Holy Grail is using a human body to power itself.

44
00:04:12,580 --> 00:04:16,870
But if this continues, the vessel's incompatibility will cause it to break apart completely.

45
00:04:18,180 --> 00:04:20,710
If that happens, there won't be a Holy Grail anymore.

46
00:04:20,710 --> 00:04:25,460
There'll just be that dangerous muck 
oozing out of the hole opened by the Grail.

47
00:04:27,130 --> 00:04:30,790
Then we have to pull Shinji out of there fast!

48
00:04:30,790 --> 00:04:31,340
Wait!

49
00:04:31,340 --> 00:04:33,180
You're just walking up to it unprepared?

50
00:04:33,180 --> 00:04:36,330
That muck is pure curses given physical form!

51
00:04:36,330 --> 00:04:38,050
We can't know if we don't try!

52
00:04:38,470 --> 00:04:40,020
There's no time to lose!

53
00:04:40,020 --> 00:04:43,040
Given who Saber's up against,

54
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:45,020
we don't have time for indecision.

55
00:04:45,020 --> 00:04:46,940
What a surprise this is.

56
00:04:47,450 --> 00:04:51,360
To think your misshapen faces would sully my vision a third time,

57
00:04:52,040 --> 00:04:53,240
mongrels.

58
00:04:54,070 --> 00:04:55,320
Gilgamesh!

59
00:04:55,700 --> 00:04:58,340
No way! If you're here, then who is Saber fighting?!

60
00:05:08,060 --> 00:05:09,870
I have been waiting.

61
00:05:09,870 --> 00:05:12,630
I am glad that you arrived in time, Saber.

62
00:05:13,050 --> 00:05:14,300
Assassin?

63
00:05:14,300 --> 00:05:15,450
Impossible.

64
00:05:15,450 --> 00:05:16,920
With Caster gone,

65
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:18,890
you should not have remained in this world!

66
00:05:20,100 --> 00:05:22,590
True, but I am a unique case, you see.

67
00:05:22,590 --> 00:05:27,310
I am a false Servant, summoned with this location as my anchor.

68
00:05:28,090 --> 00:05:33,460
Thus I am a gatekeeper that may only appear at this main gate.

69
00:05:33,460 --> 00:05:34,650
Of course,

70
00:05:35,210 --> 00:05:37,240
with that vixen gone,

71
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:40,140
I shan't survive the night.

72
00:05:40,140 --> 00:05:43,750
That I have managed to last this long is simply good fortune.

73
00:05:48,010 --> 00:05:49,630
It appears that both you and Saber

74
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:52,800
have been forsaken by fate.

75
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:59,010
Were you unaware that a Servant who yet 
lingers in this world is still at the main gate?

76
00:05:59,010 --> 00:06:00,270
Assassin...

77
00:06:00,270 --> 00:06:03,010
No way... He's still here?

78
00:06:03,590 --> 00:06:08,040
Now, then. Simply killing you would be dull.

79
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:11,270
So I shall grant you a brief reprieve.

80
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:13,420
A reprieve?

81
00:06:14,180 --> 00:06:18,880
I would feel sorry for Shinji if none but I were there at the conclusion.

82
00:06:18,880 --> 00:06:23,910
Bearing witness to how this ends will give even your lives meaning.

83
00:06:23,910 --> 00:06:29,040
Are you seriously planning to commit genocide against the human race?

84
00:06:32,690 --> 00:06:37,480
Do you think merely putting your life on the line 
entitles you to question me?

85
00:06:38,330 --> 00:06:42,180
This world has become far too kind to humans.

86
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:46,010
And therein lies your answer, little girl.

87
00:06:46,010 --> 00:06:49,800
This era, in which the rabble have bred to excess,

88
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,900
has grown far too unsightly.

89
00:06:53,030 --> 00:06:54,230
What?

90
00:06:54,690 --> 00:06:59,600
In the past—in my world—none were extraneous.

91
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:02,490
Even if one were a slave, one had purpose.

92
00:07:02,490 --> 00:07:05,710
No matter who one was, one's life had significance.

93
00:07:05,710 --> 00:07:08,150
But what of this era?

94
00:07:08,150 --> 00:07:10,890
There exists more people than there is purpose and significance.

95
00:07:11,780 --> 00:07:20,510
Surely you yourselves also believe that you have allowed your numbers to grow too great.

96
00:07:23,190 --> 00:07:28,310
So I propose to personally cull the herd of mongrels.

97
00:07:29,090 --> 00:07:32,970
The attempt ten years ago took fewer than five hundred.

98
00:07:32,970 --> 00:07:36,570
But this time, disaster will rain down upon the entire world.

99
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:39,680
Once the extraneous rabble have been weeded out,

100
00:07:40,890 --> 00:07:43,570
we shall find out how many people of value remain.

101
00:07:44,300 --> 00:07:46,200
Does the thought not excite you?

102
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:50,120
Only a sicko like you would find that exciting!

103
00:07:50,840 --> 00:07:53,290
I was a fool to expect a straight answer.

104
00:07:53,950 --> 00:07:56,540
I'll put an end to your Holy Grail right now!

105
00:07:57,300 --> 00:07:58,880
Tohsaka?

106
00:07:58,880 --> 00:08:01,040
I'll pull Shinji out.

107
00:08:01,910 --> 00:08:04,680
Whatever else he is, he's still Sakura's brother.

108
00:08:05,490 --> 00:08:06,640
Besides,

109
00:08:07,200 --> 00:08:10,840
isn't it your rule to save anyone as long as it's possible?

110
00:08:14,280 --> 00:08:16,780
You mean to simply walk through those curses?

111
00:08:16,780 --> 00:08:20,150
Do you think a lowly human could wade through that morass?

112
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:22,490
Don't underestimate me.

113
00:08:22,970 --> 00:08:26,200
I can handle curses like these as if they were nothing.

114
00:08:27,050 --> 00:08:30,700
Do or die, eh? How very charming.

115
00:08:31,340 --> 00:08:32,580
However,

116
00:08:33,130 --> 00:08:36,880
who gave you permission to leave my presence?

117
00:08:39,540 --> 00:08:41,670
Tohsaka! See to Shinji!

118
00:08:42,060 --> 00:08:43,040
On it!

119
00:08:46,640 --> 00:08:48,830
Keep your hands off Tohsaka!

120
00:08:48,830 --> 00:08:50,560
I'll take you on!

121
00:08:51,420 --> 00:08:55,020
This was to be a bit of sport before I greeted Saber,

122
00:08:55,020 --> 00:08:57,560
but it's proven most tedious.

123
00:08:58,140 --> 00:09:00,620
You filthy sham.

124
00:09:00,620 --> 00:09:05,110
Learn firsthand the difference between counterfeits and the real thing!

125
00:09:10,760 --> 00:09:12,720
Stand aside, Assassin.

126
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:15,120
Surely you have no further reason to guard this gate.

127
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:17,880
Reason, you say?

128
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:21,890
In fairness, I have never had a reason to fight.

129
00:09:21,890 --> 00:09:27,010
For I have neither the pride of a Heroic Spirit 
nor any wish to be granted.

130
00:09:27,500 --> 00:09:31,680
After all, I am not even Sasaki Kojirou.

131
00:09:33,420 --> 00:09:35,900
You need not be so astonished.

132
00:09:35,900 --> 00:09:39,110
At some point, a man named Sasaki Kojirou likely existed.

133
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:44,700
There was likely also a warrior who wielded a longsword named Monohoshizao.

134
00:09:44,700 --> 00:09:47,980
However, those two are not the same individual.

135
00:09:48,780 --> 00:09:54,680
The Sasaki Kojirou celebrated as the foil to a renowned swordsman

136
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:58,000
is but a fictional entity who never existed.

137
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:00,000
A fictional Heroic Spirit...

138
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:03,770
Indeed. "Sasaki Kojirou" is a mantle.

139
00:10:03,770 --> 00:10:09,050
I was merely the swordsman deemed most suitable to wear it.

140
00:10:09,560 --> 00:10:11,330
I have no name.

141
00:10:12,520 --> 00:10:13,960
I am but a ghost,

142
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:21,360
summoned solely for my ability to perform the techniques that Sasaki Kojirou is said to have mastered.

143
00:10:23,020 --> 00:10:26,620
Thus there was never any meaning to be found.

144
00:10:26,620 --> 00:10:31,030
I am empty, so all things are meaningless for me.

145
00:10:31,520 --> 00:10:32,380
However...

146
00:10:33,970 --> 00:10:38,140
If there was anything even I could find meaningful,

147
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:42,220
it would be this moment.

148
00:10:42,220 --> 00:10:44,960
That is, if a man who went to his death in obscurity

149
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:48,450
could have such a thing as a wish.

150
00:10:49,730 --> 00:10:50,710
Assassin...

151
00:11:02,690 --> 00:11:03,730
Come on...

152
00:11:03,730 --> 00:11:07,640
This is just too gross!

153
00:11:16,780 --> 00:11:18,160
Shit...

154
00:11:18,530 --> 00:11:21,130
Learn your place, mongrel.

155
00:11:21,130 --> 00:11:23,960
You will spoil the festivities.

156
00:11:26,040 --> 00:11:28,340
Oh, I see it is finally time.

157
00:11:55,540 --> 00:11:56,820
Boy.

158
00:11:56,820 --> 00:11:58,700
Do you know what that is?

159
00:11:59,240 --> 00:12:02,040
Those are wishes being drawn up by the Holy Grail.

160
00:12:02,040 --> 00:12:04,460
The true nature of you mongrels.

161
00:12:04,460 --> 00:12:07,500
The malevolence of humanity.

162
00:12:16,390 --> 00:12:18,860
To be able to grant any and all wishes

163
00:12:19,930 --> 00:12:23,460
means to effect material change upon the world

164
00:12:23,460 --> 00:12:26,560
beyond the limits of what can be achieved by any living thing.

165
00:12:28,470 --> 00:12:34,940
Humanity cannot grant its own wishes, for you are inherently limited beings.

166
00:12:34,940 --> 00:12:38,460
Whether they are for equality, peace, or happiness,

167
00:12:38,460 --> 00:12:43,900
those wishes will never be fulfilled by you, prisoners of your flesh.

168
00:12:45,040 --> 00:12:49,550
That is why you humans constructed that Holy Grail—

169
00:12:49,550 --> 00:12:52,740
not to be set free from all suffering

170
00:12:52,740 --> 00:12:56,140
but rather to overcome it.

171
00:13:05,690 --> 00:13:08,410
However, the end result of that ideal is as you see.

172
00:13:08,410 --> 00:13:14,460
Nothing holds more power to change the world than the malevolent desires of humanity.

173
00:13:14,460 --> 00:13:19,280
And so, fueled by malevolence, your cup of salvation can only bring about self-annihilation.

174
00:13:20,410 --> 00:13:23,040
Behold your true nature.

175
00:13:23,040 --> 00:13:26,460
Witness the shape an omnipotent wish-granter takes in this age.

176
00:13:26,880 --> 00:13:29,750
It will be far larger in scope than ten years ago.

177
00:13:30,460 --> 00:13:34,040
The curses will stream forth without end.

178
00:13:34,040 --> 00:13:35,050
Now...

179
00:13:35,710 --> 00:13:37,050
What will you do, boy?

180
00:13:42,200 --> 00:13:43,550
Good.

181
00:13:43,550 --> 00:13:46,600
This will provide me some sport.

182
00:14:01,750 --> 00:14:02,810
Shinji...

183
00:14:07,670 --> 00:14:10,690
Come on, time to get out of this awful place.

184
00:14:15,290 --> 00:14:19,390
He may be a useless core, but you don't want to let him go?

185
00:14:30,530 --> 00:14:33,820
Well, I guess anyone would be upset at having their heart yanked out.

186
00:14:34,650 --> 00:14:36,740
Down we go, Shinji.

187
00:14:44,870 --> 00:14:47,840
To be king is so constrictive.

188
00:14:47,840 --> 00:14:52,000
The instant I take a mongrel like you seriously, 
that is defeat in my eyes.

189
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:55,030
Hence, you may rejoice.

190
00:14:55,030 --> 00:14:57,090
I shall not go all-out against you.

191
00:14:57,400 --> 00:14:58,510
Trace...

192
00:14:59,430 --> 00:15:00,300
on!

193
00:15:07,230 --> 00:15:08,560
Trace on!

194
00:15:09,010 --> 00:15:10,120
What's the matter?

195
00:15:10,120 --> 00:15:11,940
Your quality seems to be slipping.

196
00:15:12,650 --> 00:15:16,220
Is your tongue the only thing of substance about you, faker?

197
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:19,180
It's up to you...

198
00:15:19,780 --> 00:15:21,490
to defeat him.

199
00:15:21,490 --> 00:15:23,010
Damn it, Archer...

200
00:15:23,010 --> 00:15:25,410
How am I supposed to do that?

201
00:15:25,970 --> 00:15:30,390
I'm not good enough to fend off his Noble Phantasms.

202
00:15:30,390 --> 00:15:33,420
There's only one thing I can do.

203
00:15:33,850 --> 00:15:39,170
My only hope is to neutralize the Noble Phantasms he fires by firing back the exact same items.

204
00:15:39,690 --> 00:15:40,580
So...

205
00:15:42,460 --> 00:15:43,550
Trace...

206
00:15:49,600 --> 00:15:51,160
I'll copy them all.

207
00:15:52,390 --> 00:15:53,630
Every last one!

208
00:15:54,250 --> 00:15:54,940
...on!

209
00:16:04,070 --> 00:16:06,710
Possession experience, assimilation complete!

210
00:16:06,710 --> 00:16:09,620
Production complete! All projections, stand by!

211
00:16:09,960 --> 00:16:13,120
Oh, you're producing several this time.

212
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:18,250
I see. You have duplicated all of my 
Noble Phantasms in your field of view.

213
00:16:18,830 --> 00:16:20,460
Then let us score your efforts.

214
00:16:21,210 --> 00:16:23,660
Of course, no matter how faithful the reproductions,

215
00:16:23,660 --> 00:16:26,760
I shan't allow a single one to remain.

216
00:16:26,760 --> 00:16:28,600
Release freeze...

217
00:16:28,600 --> 00:16:31,520
All projections, successive fire!

218
00:16:39,610 --> 00:16:42,600
Quite durable, for glasswork.

219
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:46,910
But if you don't copy faster, you'll be cut to pieces.

220
00:16:46,910 --> 00:16:49,070
Trace on!

221
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:54,920
What an utterly foolish notion.

222
00:16:55,700 --> 00:17:00,820
You were right to target the Holy Grail 
under the assumption that you cannot beat me.

223
00:17:01,690 --> 00:17:06,810
But if that is your thinking, simply killing that man would be better.

224
00:17:06,810 --> 00:17:09,040
If you wish to stop the Holy Grail,

225
00:17:09,040 --> 00:17:12,180
the most effective way is to eliminate Shinji.

226
00:17:12,710 --> 00:17:16,440
To try to save him nonetheless is hypocrisy.

227
00:17:16,950 --> 00:17:19,770
An act which sums up you mongrels perfectly.

228
00:17:25,180 --> 00:17:26,030
What?

229
00:17:42,930 --> 00:17:46,410
It's lost its core and now desires me as its replacement?

230
00:17:52,810 --> 00:17:53,920
Tohsaka...

231
00:18:05,950 --> 00:18:07,610
What the hell is that?

232
00:18:08,130 --> 00:18:09,740
I can't get a read on it.

233
00:18:09,740 --> 00:18:14,120
I can't even get a read on its structure!

234
00:18:22,280 --> 00:18:23,710
Exterminate it,

235
00:18:24,260 --> 00:18:24,880
Ea.

236
00:18:41,810 --> 00:18:44,780
I thought I was holding back.

237
00:18:45,360 --> 00:18:49,860
But at this rate, sparing Archer would have afforded me more amusement,

238
00:18:50,570 --> 00:18:51,800
boy.

239
00:18:59,270 --> 00:19:00,700
That shockwave just now...

240
00:19:09,180 --> 00:19:10,240
Our positions...

241
00:19:11,140 --> 00:19:13,600
Assassin, are you...

242
00:19:15,210 --> 00:19:17,520
If I disengage from this man, he will use it.

243
00:19:18,390 --> 00:19:19,670
His sword technique...

244
00:19:21,550 --> 00:19:24,710
Is it wise to pull your blows?

245
00:19:24,710 --> 00:19:28,280
If you persist, I could force you back.

246
00:19:28,810 --> 00:19:31,860
Is that why you deliberately entered my range?

247
00:19:32,310 --> 00:19:35,290
I have come to force an end to our contest, of course.

248
00:19:35,290 --> 00:19:38,870
When in a duel, do not let your mind wander to what comes after.

249
00:19:39,660 --> 00:19:42,810
If I try to put some distance between us,

250
00:19:42,810 --> 00:19:44,860
I will play right into his hands.

251
00:19:46,070 --> 00:19:47,630
Why do you hesitate?

252
00:19:47,630 --> 00:19:52,160
Just as I guard this gate, you guard something of your own.

253
00:19:52,160 --> 00:19:54,390
So there should be no room for doubt.

254
00:19:55,260 --> 00:19:57,390
Besides, Saber...

255
00:19:57,800 --> 00:20:01,140
You are not the only one running out of time.

256
00:20:02,900 --> 00:20:04,540
I have done you a discourtesy.

257
00:20:04,540 --> 00:20:07,570
As you say, we are both out of time.

258
00:20:33,340 --> 00:20:34,760
Secret technique:

259
00:20:34,760 --> 00:20:36,180
Swallow Reversal!

260
00:20:56,170 --> 00:20:57,120
Go.

261
00:21:06,720 --> 00:21:09,880
I'd thought her to be a lovely little bird,

262
00:21:10,920 --> 00:21:14,490
but it seems she was closer to a lioness.

263
00:21:18,490 --> 00:21:21,670
And to think I considered myself a fair judge of women.

264
00:21:23,270 --> 00:21:27,690
I suppose my training in that art is equally wanting.

265
00:23:26,890 --> 00:23:29,120
Only the supreme ruler may wield that blade.

266
00:23:29,120 --> 00:23:32,690
Can being summoned incorrectly change a Servant so drastically?

267
00:23:32,690 --> 00:23:35,850
But if I don't get there in time, do what has to be done.

268
00:23:35,850 --> 00:23:37,770
Here I come, King of Heroes.

269
00:23:37,770 --> 00:23:39,980
Do you have enough weapons in stock?

